{
  "title": "Network ACL · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "서브넷 경계에서 들어오고 나가는 트래픽을 허용하거나 차단합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#guide-1\">규칙을 적용하는 순서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#guide-2\">응답 경로까지 허용하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>34 / 62</span></div><h1>Network ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>NACL은 <strong>서브넷 단위로 적용하는 네트워크 접근 제어 규칙</strong>입니다. 특정 IP 범위의 접속을 차단하거나 서브넷의 공통 통신 기준을 설정할 때 사용합니다.</p><p>보안 그룹이 개별 리소스의 연결을 제어한다면, NACL은 서브넷 경계의 트래픽을 검사합니다. NACL은 상태 비저장 방식<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>이므로 요청과 응답 방향을 각각 허용해야 합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"rule-number-and-first-match\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"allow-and-deny\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"inbound-and-outbound\"></span><h2>규칙을 적용하는 순서</h2><p>인바운드와 아웃바운드 규칙을 따로 작성하며, 각 규칙에 번호와 허용 또는 거부 동작을 지정합니다. 작은 번호부터 검사해 처음 일치한 규칙을 적용합니다.</p><p>아무 규칙에도 일치하지 않으면 마지막 기본 규칙에서 거부됩니다. 새 사용자 지정 NACL을 연결하기 전에 필요한 통신 규칙을 먼저 준비합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"ephemeral-ports\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"default-and-custom-network-acl\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"network-acl-and-security-group\"></span><h2>응답 경로까지 허용하기</h2><p>클라이언트는 요청을 보낼 때 임시 포트를 사용할 수 있습니다. 서버의 서비스 포트만 허용하면 요청은 도착해도 응답이 차단될 수 있으므로 반대 방향의 임시 포트 범위도 고려합니다.</p><p>특정 출처를 명시적으로 차단할 때 NACL을 활용할 수 있습니다. 리소스별 세밀한 접근 허용은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">보안 그룹</a>과 함께 구성합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>NACL 규칙의 평가</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>트래픽 도착</strong><span>출발지·목적지·포트 확인</span></li><li><strong>작은 번호부터 비교</strong><span>첫 일치 규칙 선택</span></li><li><strong>허용 또는 거부</strong><span>응답 방향도 별도 검사</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">요청을 허용했다는 이유만으로 응답 트래픽이 자동 허용되지는 않습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>비정상 접속을 반복하는 IP 범위를 서브넷 수준에서 차단합니다. 기존 허용 규칙보다 먼저 적용되도록 낮은 번호의 거부 규칙을 추가합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>상태 비저장 방식</strong> — 앞서 허용한 연결을 기억하지 않고 각 패킷을 규칙에 따라 평가하는 방식입니다. 요청과 응답에 필요한 규칙을 각각 구성합니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/vpc-network-acls.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Control subnet traffic with network access control lists ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q014/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q014\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q014\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q014</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q014/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to explicitly deny traffic from a source IP range across an entire subnet. Which control should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A deny rule in a security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q014\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI attribute</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a> 수준에서 명시적 거부를 지원하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>는 허용 규칙만 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q015\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q015\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q015</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q015/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A custom network ACL allows inbound TCP port 443, but return traffic is blocked. What should be checked?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q015\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 bucket name</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q015\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CloudTrail retention period</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q015\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Outbound network ACL rules for the response port range</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q015\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The AMI's Region</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>은 상태 비저장이므로 응답 방향도 허용해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q009\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q008\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q008\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q006\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q006\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q006</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which IP address falls within the 10.0.1.0/24 CIDR block?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.2.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">10.1.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q006\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.0.124</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · /24는 앞 24비트, 곧 이 예시의 10.0.1이 같아야 한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 예약 주소 여부도 별도로 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">이전 용어 <b>NAT Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">다음 용어 <b>Object / File / Block</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
